SULLAMUL HIFZ v1.9.0 — TPA LAUNCH COMPLETE

Baseline: v1.6.1 — Qari Tahfizh
Release type: additive application/database upgrade
Deployment target: GitHub main → Coolify → Dockerfile → NGINX Unit
Public site: https://sullamulhifz.or.id
Portal: https://app.sullamulhifz.or.id

Key additions:
- Meeting type, completion state and guardian summary.
- Bulk attendance and richer Tahsin/Tahfizh/Murajaah records.
- Daily teacher workspace.
- Audio-linked assignments and guardian evidence checklist.
- Guardian monthly summaries.
- Monthly/task CSV reports and richer report-card source data.
- Launch-readiness control panel.
- Security response headers, PWA/offline fallback and friendly error pages.
- Idempotent launch template seeder, startup verification and smoke test.

Data policy:
- Existing santri, wali, guru, classes, groups, records and accounts are preserved.
- Migration is additive.
- No production wipe/fresh/install seeder is part of startup.
- Real attendance, assessment and report data must not be fabricated.

